{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24573","headline":"春日闲居三首 三 · 白居易","name":"春日闲居三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳者不觉歌，歌其劳苦事。\n逸者不觉歌，歌其逸乐意。\n问我逸如何，闲居多兴味。\n问我乐如何，闲官少忧累。\n又问俸厚薄，百千随月至。\n又问年几何，七十行欠二。\n所得皆过望，省躬良可媿。\n马闲无羁绊，鹤老有禄位。\n设自爲化工，优饶只如是。\n安得不歌咏，默默受天赐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}